png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord%20Eye\"><img alt=\"Bonelord Eye\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bonelord_Eye_6950d8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Rod\"><img alt=\"Terra Rod\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terra_Rod_720f3f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Bonelord Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bonelord_Shield_34cfc1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Life Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Ring_d8e154.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Two%20Handed%20Sword\"><img alt=\"Two Handed Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Two_Handed_Sword_90f1f9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Map Alatar Lake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"95\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_Alatar_Lake_a834dc.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Alatar Lake</b> is a nice location to hunt your first <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelord</a> without getting surrounded by other <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creatures</a> like <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummies</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost\">Ghosts</a>.<br/>\nThe lake is named after Alatar, the Sage.\n</p><p>It is a place of spirituality and magic. Also, one of the few <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Frog\">Green Frog</a> outside premium account area spawns here with the boss monster <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Frog%20Prince\">The Frog Prince</a>.<br/>\n</p><p>The cave is divided in four rooms with a total of two <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelords</a> and one <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a>. In the northern room there is also a <a href=\"#/wiki/List%20of%20Pickable%20Holes\">hidden pick hole</a> which leads to nothing but some squares in between two barriers.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Map Alatar Lake2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"149\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_Alatar_Lake2_da6d05.png\" width=\"149\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"w-Creatures_around.2Funder_Alatar_Lake\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures_around/under_Alatar_Lake\">Creatures around/under Alatar Lake</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Purple%29\"><img alt=\"Butterfly (Purple)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Butterfly_Purple_4bdd3e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Purple%29\">Butterfly (Purple)</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\"><img alt=\"Ghoul\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" load